  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: Que?...
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: Escuche algo?
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "No... debe de ser el cansancio. Llevo demasiado tiempo aqu\xED"
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "...Mam\xE1?"
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "No, no puede ser. Ella ya no est\xE1..."
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "Entonces, Por qu\xE9 siento que alguien me esta mirando?"
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb18f3abb18647147b148517b05d757c, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: Tengo que seguir caminando... solo necesito salir de este bosque
